      "rationale": "Kumasen in ye sɛbɛnni-yɛlɛma gɛlɛn ye: 'a jama bɛ segin' wa walima 'Elohim b'a jama bila yɔrɔ min na'? ani 'ji min bɛ dan, o bɛ wuluwulu u ye' — jatew bɛ wuli, dɔw fɔ ko ji bɛ tugu ɲɔgɔn na, dɔw fɔ ko nɔgɔya bɛ u bolo."
